@host = http://localhost:8080
@adminKey = replace-with-your-Platform-AdminApiKey
@botToken = 123456:replace-with-a-BotFather-token

### Liveness probe (no auth)
GET {{host}}/health

### List available behaviors (built-in + uploaded extensions)
GET {{host}}/admin/behaviors
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Register a new bot with the built-in echo behavior
POST {{host}}/admin/bots
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "My Echo Bot",
  "behaviorKey": "echo",
  "token": "{{botToken}}"
}

### List registered bots and their status
GET {{host}}/admin/bots
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Get one bot
GET {{host}}/admin/bots/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Disable a bot (stops serving; keeps its data)
POST {{host}}/admin/bots/1/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Re-enable a bot
POST {{host}}/admin/bots/1/enable
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Rotate a bot's token
PUT {{host}}/admin/bots/1/token
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "123456:new-token-from-botfather"
}

### Remove a bot
DELETE {{host}}/admin/bots/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}

### Upload a behavior extension (compiled plugin DLL) at runtime
# Build samples/ReverseBehavior first, then point this at its DLL.
POST {{host}}/admin/behaviors
Authorization: Bearer {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----plugin

------plugin
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="package"; filename="ReverseBehavior.dll"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./../../samples/ReverseBehavior/bin/Release/net10.0/ReverseBehavior.dll
------plugin--
